<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Coca-Cola said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co upgraded Coca-Cola Co to buy from market perform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- shares rose one to 56-5/8.</p>
</text>
